<title>CANADA: Canada RBR skedline.</title>
<headline>Canada RBR skedline.</headline>
<text>
<p>TORONTO - The Toronto Stock Exchange, Canada's largest, has shot up by more than 100 points during the last two days as buying momentum has pushed the key index to almost 6000 points. (BY LYDIA ZAJC, EXPECT BY 5:30 p.m., BC-STOCKS-CANADA)</p>
